# multi_asset: expiry boundary checks interleaved across different assets.
# Synthetic. Layout: fuzz/README.md (8 bytes per step).
00 00 00 00 00 50 00 03  # create asset 0, dur 10
00 01 01 01 00 50 00 00  # create asset 1, dur 50
04 01 00 00 00 00 00 00  # advance ledger by 10 (asset 0 at exact expiry, asset 1 still open)
01 00 00 10 00 00 00 00  # settle expired asset 0 session (rejected)
02 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  # cancel expired asset 0 session (rejected)
03 01 00 00 00 00 00 00  # recover unexpired asset 1 session (rejected)
03 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  # recover expired asset 0 session (succeeds)
01 01 00 10 00 00 00 00  # settle unexpired asset 1 session (succeeds)
